{"id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","title":"Equivalence Relation","display":"df-equivalence-relation — Equivalence Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-equivalence-relation","aliases":["58-df-equivalence-relation","Equivalence Relation","58-df-zfc-equivalence-relation","58-df-zfc-order7-equivalence-relation"],"display":"df-equivalence-relation — Equivalence Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-equivalence-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-equivalence-relation</span><span>Equivalence Relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-equivalence-relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-order7-equivalence-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equivalence-relation — Equivalence Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,X)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\\left(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\\left(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalence class: all elements equivalent to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span></li>\n<li>Partition: collection of disjoint nonempty subsets covering <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span></li>\n<li>Fundamental theorem of equivalence: partitions correspond to equivalence relations</li>\n<li>Quotient set: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X/R = \\{[x]_R : x \\in X\\}\">\\(X/R = \\{[x]_R : x \\in X\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Kernel: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ker(f) = \\{(x,y) : f(x) = f(y)\\}\">\\(\\ker(f) = \\{(x,y) : f(x) = f(y)\\}\\)</span> is an equivalence relation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enderton, A Mathematical Introduction to Logic</li>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in V$（see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq X\\times X$（see [[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\\left(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X/R = \\{[x]_R : x \\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ker(f) = \\{(x,y) : f(x) = f(y)\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1435,"backlinks":[{"id":"37b6b6dcccf0b425","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])"},{"id":"4fcdcfdb0b1f6b92","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2e668662ec71d852","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2$（参数顺序为 $(R,A)$，see [[58-df-equivalence-relation]]）"},{"id":"de46efac56b1e2dc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{EquivRel}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"4c912f9b1462f965","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Order}_S,\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-order]] and [[58-df-equivalence-relation]])"},{"id":"bf393c071d76e455","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])"},{"id":"3e2e6a2f5d909f84","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,P)$ (equivalence-relation predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])"},{"id":"48b6b0dc312679c4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"789663ed3a5f1b82","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"91088925c254ba07","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S$ is the equivalence-relation predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])"},{"id":"4397ca2cdf99ab61","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"122041b020150c8e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$E$ (equivalence relation, see [[../batch02/58-df-equiv